#: ../../source/docs/USB-IDs.rst:5 e79e6ef0b8fa4fb7a6d94c0752dfe511
msgid "USB IDs in ArduPilot"
msgstr "ArduPilot 中的 USB ID"

#: ../../source/docs/USB-IDs.rst:7 6d6f5d533f5c4c838f3331d765874481
msgid ""
"ArduPilot uses a range of USB IDs for various flight controllers and "
"devices. This document describes the IDs in active use as well as past IDs "
"that may be on some boards."
msgstr "ArduPilot 为各种飞控和设备使用一系列 USB ID。本文档描述了正在使用的 ID 以及某些飞控板上可能存在的历史 ID。"

#: ../../source/docs/USB-IDs.rst:12 f612c5f114c648d6800089fb86a0cfd3
msgid "Composite Devices"
msgstr "复合设备"

#: ../../source/docs/USB-IDs.rst:14 aec2f1694d3741e6a59a628a1da768ea
msgid ""
"In the information below some IDs are marked as being for composite USB "
"devices. These are for boards which will present two serial interfaces for "
"one USB connection. Boards that use composite IDs will have both OTG1 and "
"OTG2 in their SERIAL_ORDER declaration in the hwdef.dat for the board. These"
" devices should have a different USB VID/PID pair from non-composite boards "
"to allow the correct driver to be loaded on Microsoft Windows."
msgstr ""
"以下信息中，某些 ID 被标记为复合 USB 设备。这些是针对一个 USB 连接提供两个串口接口的飞控板。使用复合 ID 的飞控板在其 "
"hwdef.dat 的 SERIAL_ORDER 声明中同时包含 OTG1 和 OTG2。这些设备应与非复合飞控板有不同的 USB VID/PID "
"对，以便在 Microsoft Windows 上加载正确的驱动。"

#: ../../source/docs/USB-IDs.rst:22 9e05a4ee4e7e46e18fcced12f1b11434
msgid ""
"When a board uses a composite USB ID two serial ports are presented to the "
"host. The user can configure what protocols these two ports use using the "
"SERIALn_PROTOCOL parameter. SERIAL0_PROTOCOL is the first USB interface, and"
" SERIALn_PROTOCOL for the largest value of n on the board is the 2nd USB "
"interface. Typically the 2nd interface is used to give a SLCAN interface for"
" CAN diagnostics and configuration."
msgstr ""
"当飞控板使用复合 USB ID 时，主机将看到两个串口。用户可以使用 SERIALn_PROTOCOL "
"参数配置这两个端口使用的协议。SERIAL0_PROTOCOL 是第一个 USB 接口，飞控板上 n 最大值对应的 SERIALn_PROTOCOL "
"是第二个 USB 接口。通常第二个接口用于提供用于 CAN 诊断和配置的 SLCAN 接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/USB-IDs.rst:30 d3ab66014b3b4792b4cf79b725d9c819
msgid "VID=0x0483 PID=0x5740"
msgstr "VID=0x0483 PID=0x5740"

#: ../../source/docs/USB-IDs.rst:32 c752c8fdaf3b447daeb80a52bb45b903
msgid ""
"This ID is one from ST Microelectronics, and was used by ArduPilot in the "
"initial ChibiOS port until January 2020. It is a non-composite serial ID."
msgstr ""
"此 ID 来自 ST Microelectronics，ArduPilot 在最初的 ChibiOS 移植中使用，直至 2020 年 1 "
"月。它是非复合串行 ID。"

#: ../../source/docs/USB-IDs.rst:37 fd4d8daf4d8f4610940b9b542b693690
msgid "VID=0x1209 PID=0x5740"
msgstr "VID=0x1209 PID=0x5740"

#: ../../source/docs/USB-IDs.rst:39 aefbd8c9baef462b9bb5b0348e546946
msgid ""
"This ID is one from http://pid.codes/, and is used by ArduPilot since "
"December 2019. It is a composite serial ID, with interface 0 labelled as "
"MAVLink and interface 2 labelled as SLCAN. It is the default USB ID for "
"boards capable of composite USB devices."
msgstr ""
"此 ID 来自 http://pid.codes/，ArduPilot 自 2019 年 12 月起使用。它是复合串行 ID，接口 0 标记为 "
"MAVLink，接口 2 标记为 SLCAN。它是支持复合 USB 设备的飞控板的默认 USB ID。"

#: ../../source/docs/USB-IDs.rst:45 5b63c00ef7444054b41d840563c2c753
msgid "VID=0x1209 PID=0x5741"
msgstr "VID=0x1209 PID=0x5741"

#: ../../source/docs/USB-IDs.rst:47 a76ca08085bd4570a7ce3bf711dc2b62
msgid ""
"This ID is one from http://pid.codes/, and is used by ArduPilot since "
"January 2020. It is a non-composite serial ID. It is the default USB ID for "
"boards non-composite USB devices, including bootloaders and all F4 based "
"boards."
msgstr ""
"此 ID 来自 http://pid.codes/，ArduPilot 自 2020 年 1 月起使用。它是非复合串行 ID，是非复合 USB "
"设备飞控板的默认 USB ID，包括引导加载程序和所有基于 F4 的飞控板。"

#: ../../source/docs/USB-IDs.rst:53 f291e22f121d464a89c216ec60f62491
msgid "VID=0x16D0 PID=0x0E65"
msgstr "VID=0x16D0 PID=0x0E65"

#: ../../source/docs/USB-IDs.rst:55 8edd45fb5ee44e4f8dc8629cdcdc6693
msgid ""
"This ID is one from https://www.mcselec.com, and is reserved for use by "
"ArduPilot in the future."
msgstr "此 ID 来自 https://www.mcselec.com，保留供 ArduPilot 未来使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/USB-IDs.rst:59 067762bbb844424294e4814044ed8b4e
msgid "VID=0x26AC PID=various"
msgstr "VID=0x26AC PID=各种"

#: ../../source/docs/USB-IDs.rst:61 1f087942b59b46979b235efdc953346f
msgid ""
"The 0x26AC vendor ID is owned by 3D Robotics, and was used for most "
"ArduPilot compatible boards up until 2018. Some boards still ship with a "
"bootloader that uses that VID."
msgstr ""
"0x26AC 厂商 ID 由 3D Robotics 拥有，直至 2018 年被大多数 ArduPilot 兼容飞控板使用。某些飞控板仍随附使用该 "
"VID 的引导加载程序出货。"

#: ../../source/docs/USB-IDs.rst:66 10410ea5610a4db8a9efe7bbf84f014c
msgid "VID=0x2DAE PID=various"
msgstr "VID=0x2DAE PID=各种"

